# ── Source spreadsheets ─────────────────────────────────────────────
# The raw exports stay out of the repository — they are working files, and the
# application does not read them at runtime.
#
# The DERIVED snapshot the portal serves, content/portal-snapshot.json, IS
# committed. It carries real customer names, order values and schedules, on the
# decision of the data owner (docs/DECISIONS.md, D10). Keep this repository
# private, and treat a change to that decision as a change to this file.
data/
*.xlsx
*.xlsm
*.xls
*.csv
snapshots/

# ── Secrets ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key

